  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Empoderamiento econmico mediante alternativas de generacin de ingresos para las mujeres de comunidades rurales de El Viejo, Chinandega</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Violence and discrimination affect women from rural communities of El Viejo who are often economically dependent on others to support their livelihoods. Asociacin Para el Desarrollo Integral de la Mujer (APADEIM) works to identify income-producing activities that improve the quality of life for these residents. At the IAF we support community-led solutions to expand economic opportunity in Nicaragua. APADIEM&apos;s activities strengthen excluded communities so they can improve their living conditions and participate equally in a nation&apos;s political economic and social life.</narrative>
  </description>
